# Governor state. A governed run (`gaap run --policy ...`) writes its ledger, key
# ring, refs, content store and kill switch into the state directory, which
# defaults to `.gaap` in the working directory. That is a record of a session, not
# a source file: an empty ledger.jsonl reached the tree once already.
.gaap/

